    "title": "About PPK",
    "content_html": "　　山田尚子（Yamada Naoko，1984年11月28日—）<br/>　　<a href=\"https://www.douban.com/link2/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fja.wikipedia.org%2Fwiki%2F%25E5%25B1%25B1%25E7%2594%25B0%25E5%25B0%259A%25E5%25AD%2590\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Wikipedia</a>　<a href=\"https://www.douban.com/link2/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.kyotoanimation.co.jp%2Fstaff%2Fanibaka%2Fblog%2F%3Fauthor%3D18\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">THE☆アニメバカ一代</a>（<a href=\"https://www.douban.com/link2/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fsite.douban.com%2F211330%2Fwidget%2Fnotes%2F17565710%2F\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">翻译</a>）<br/>　　日本动画演出家、导演。爱称“Papico（Papiko）”。毕业于京都造型艺术大学美术造型专业西洋画科。毕业后进入京都动画作为一名原画师开始工作。在《CLANNAD》中首次出任演出一职。2009年在《轻音！》中初次担任导演。<br/>　　被鹤冈阳太与石原立也称为<a href=\"https://www.douban.com/link2/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsite.douban.com%2F211330%2Fwidget%2Fnotes%2F13431979%2Fnote%2F518061571%2F\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">“青春的巨匠”</a>。<br/>　○ 作品特征、创作信念：<br/>　　用肯定的态度去描绘事物。肯定世界，肯定每一个角色。找出人物的优点用积极的方式去表现。<br/>　　爱用实拍的手法，喜欢能感受到第三者视线的影像。将每个角色当作真实存在的人去拍摄。<br/>　○ 执导作品：<br/>　　<a href=\"https://www.douban.com/link2/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fmovie.douban.com%2Fsubject_search%3Fsearch_text%3D%25E8%25BD%25BB%25E9%259F%25B3%25E5%25B0%2591%25E5%25A5%25B3%26cat%3D1002\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">《轻音！》系列</a>、<a href=\"https://www.douban.com/link2/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fmovie.douban.com%2Fsubject%2F20514713%2F\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">《玉子市场》</a>、<a href=\"https://www.douban.com/link2/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fmovie.douban.com%2Fsubject%2F25796222%2F\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">《玉子爱情故事》</a>、<a href=\"https://www.douban.com/link2/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fkoenokatachi-movie.com%2F\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">《聲之形》</a>、<a href=\"https://www.douban.com/link2/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fliz-bluebird.com%2F\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">《丽兹与青鸟》</a>、<a href=\"https://www.douban.com/link2/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fheike-anime.asmik-ace.co.jp%2F\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">《平家物语》</a><br/>　○ 喜欢的导演（<a href=\"https://www.douban.com/link2/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.douban.com%2Fdoulist%2F43095035%2F\" rel=\"nofollow\">豆列</a>）：<br/>　　<a href=\"https://www.douban.com/link2/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fmovie.douban.com%2Fcelebrity%2F1054506%2F\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">杨·史云梅耶</a>、<a href=\"https://www.douban.com/link2/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fmovie.douban.com%2Fcelebrity%2F1014248%2F\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">谢尔盖·帕拉杰诺夫</a>、<a href=\"https://www.douban.com/link2/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fmovie.douban.com%2Fcelebrity%2F1036727%2F\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">小津安二郎</a>、<a href=\"https://www.douban.com/link2/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fmovie.douban.com%2Fcelebrity%2F1000561%2F\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">罗伊·安德森</a>、<a href=\"https://www.douban.com/link2/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fmovie.douban.com%2Fcelebrity%2F1054399%2F\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">索菲亚·科波拉</a>、<a href=\"https://www.douban.com/link2/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fmovie.douban.com%2Fcelebrity%2F1004767%2F\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">亚历桑德罗·佐杜洛夫斯基</a><br/>　○ 喜欢的电影（<a href=\"https://www.douban.com/link2/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.douban.com%2Fdoulist%2F43094984%2F\" rel=\"nofollow\">豆列</a>）：<br/>　　<a href=\"https://www.douban.com/link2/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fmovie.douban.com%2Fsubject%2F1305817%2F\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">《爱丽丝》</a>、<a href=\"https://www.douban.com/link2/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fmovie.douban.com%2Fsubject%2F1401905%2F\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">《圣山》</a>、<a href=\"https://www.douban.com/link2/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fmovie.douban.com%2Fsubject%2F1303542%2F\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">《石榴的颜色》</a>、<a href=\"https://www.douban.com/link2/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fmovie.douban.com%2Fsubject%2F1444232%2F\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">《纯真》</a>、<a href=\"https://www.douban.com/link2/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fmovie.douban.com%2Fsubject%2F1291835%2F\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">《迷失东京》</a>、<a href=\"https://www.douban.com/link2/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fmovie.douban.com%2Fsubject%2F1463934%2F\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">《瑞典爱情故事》</a>、<a href=\"https://www.douban.com/link2/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fmovie.douban.com%2Fsubject%2F2222954%2F\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">《CHECKERS in TANTAN たぬき》</a>、<a href=\"https://www.douban.com/link2/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fmovie.douban.com%2Fsubject%2F11527487%2F\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">《弗兰西丝·哈》</a>、<a href=\"https://www.douban.com/link2/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fmovie.douban.com%2Fsubject%2F1301678%2F\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">《坏血》</a>、<a href=\"https://www.douban.com/link2/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fmovie.douban.com%2Fsubject%2F1291560%2F\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">《龙猫》</a>、<a href=\"https://www.douban.com/link2/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fmovie.douban.com%2Fsubject%2F1291585%2F\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">《风之谷》</a>、<a href=\"https://www.douban.com/link2/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fmovie.douban.com%2Fsubject%2F3744753%2F\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">《赫伯和多乐茜》</a>、<a href=\"https://www.douban.com/link2/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmovie.douban.com%2Fsubject%2F25855071%2F\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">《Sing Street》</a><br/>　○ 喜欢的电视剧：<br/>　　<a href=\"https://www.douban.com/link2/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmovie.douban.com%2Fsubject%2F26266666%2F\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">《问题餐厅》</a><br/>　○ 喜欢的漫画家・插画家：<br/>　　<a href=\"https://www.douban.com/link2/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.recosuke.com%2F\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">本秀康</a><br/>　○ 喜欢的音乐类型：<br/>　　Techno、New Wave、Punk、Progressive Rock<br/>　○ 喜欢的音乐艺人：<br/>　　<a href=\"https://www.douban.com/link2/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fja.wikipedia.org%2Fwiki%2F%25E9%259B%25BB%25E6%25B0%2597%25E3%2582%25B0%25E3%2583%25AB%25E3%2583%25BC%25E3%2583%25B4\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">電気グルーヴ</a>、<a href=\"https://www.douban.com/link2/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fja.wikipedia.org%2Fwiki%2F%25E3%2582%25A4%25E3%2582%25A8%25E3%2583%25AD%25E3%2583%25BC%25E3%2583%25BB%25E3%2583%259E%25E3%2582%25B8%25E3%2583%2583%25E3%2582%25AF%25E3%2583%25BB%25E3%2582%25AA%25E3%2583%25BC%25E3%2582%25B1%25E3%2582%25B9%25E3%2583%2588%25E3%2583%25A9\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">YMO</a>、<a href=\"https://www.douban.com/link2/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fzh.wikipedia.org%2Fwiki%2F%25E5%25A4%25A7%25E5%258D%25AB%25C2%25B7%25E9%25B2%258D%25E4%25BC%258A\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">大卫·鲍伊</a>、<a href=\"https://www.douban.com/link2/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fja.wikipedia.org%2Fwiki%2FBUCK-TICK\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">BUCK-TICK</a>、<a href=\"https://www.douban.com/link2/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fqrion.net%2F\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Qrion</a><br/>　○ 喜欢的建筑师・设计师：<br/>　　<a href=\"https://www.douban.com/link2/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fbaike.baidu.com%2Fview%2F6785272.htm\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">麦金托什</a><br/>　○ 学生时代的社团活动：<br/>　　排球部（小学・初中）、网球部・摄影部（高中）、特摄部（大学）<br/>　○ 大学时期的艺术演变：<br/>　　山田尚子原本在大学中专攻油画，到三年级时她发现“画布无法表现自己想创作的东西”，于是开始制作立体造型。正当大家专心致力于绘画时，她却在削泡沫塑料。毕业设计则制作了齿轮在马达的带动下无限转动的艺术作品。前来参观的祖母说“小尚你不是为了学画画才读大学的吗…”，本人因此很沮丧。——也就是说，原本专攻二维（油画）的她为更接近真实而到达了三维（立体造型），并且在毕业设计时又进化成四维（在立体造型中加入旋转的齿轮=添加了时间轴）。",
