    "content_html": "《轻音！》（TV第1期 2009）　<a href=\"https://www.douban.com/link2/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.tbs.co.jp%2Fanime%2Fk-on%2Fk-on_tv%2Findex-j.html\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">官网</a>　<a href=\"https://www.douban.com/link2/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fja.wikipedia.org%2Fwiki%2F%25E3%2581%2591%25E3%2581%2584%25E3%2581%258A%25E3%2582%2593%21\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Wikipedia</a>　<a href=\"https://www.douban.com/link2/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fwww42.atwiki.jp%2Fkeionbu%2F\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">まとめwiki</a><br/>《轻音！！》（TV第2期 2010）<br/>《电影 轻音！》（Movie 2011）<br/>能否传达至你心中呢？虽然现在我还没有信心<br/>但是请听我唱不要笑，这首歌饱含着我的感情<br/>我想通过歌声，表达心中所有的感谢<br/>我会将这份感恩之心铭记于心，永生不忘<br/>——《U&amp;I》<br/>【站外推荐】<br/><a href=\"https://www.douban.com/link2/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fpriority1.blog51.fc2.com%2Fblog-category-3.html\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">TV第二期感想</a><br/><a href=\"https://www.douban.com/link2/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fpriority1.blog51.fc2.com%2Fblog-entry-444.html\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">作品への簡単な総括と、最終回へのいくつかの私見</a><br/><a href=\"https://www.douban.com/link2/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fpriority1.blog51.fc2.com%2Fblog-entry-450.html\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">＜構造解析＞　将来・進路決定の物語</a><br/><a href=\"https://www.douban.com/link2/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fpriority1.blog51.fc2.com%2Fblog-entry-1498.html\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">【映画感想・読解・考察】 過去の関連記事のインデックス</a><br/><a href=\"https://www.douban.com/link2/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fpriority1.blog51.fc2.com%2Fblog-entry-1758.html\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">映画けいおん！時系列順作品解説（2013ver.）</a><br/><a href=\"https://www.douban.com/link2/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fpriority1.blog51.fc2.com%2Fblog-entry-1674.html\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">映画「さらば青春の光」を通してのED解釈</a><br/><a href=\"https://www.douban.com/link2/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fpriority1.blog51.fc2.com%2Fblog-entry-1677.html\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">映画「エコール」を通してのED解釈</a><br/><a href=\"https://www.douban.com/link2/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fpriority1.blog51.fc2.com%2Fblog-entry-1759.html\" r