    "content_html": "☆【穹庐下的魔女】<br/><a href=\"https://www.douban.com/link2/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.douban.com%2Ftopic%2F499780453%2F\" rel=\"nofollow\">“珍视角色”——唯有这一点，无论创作什么作品，我都会绝不动摇地坚守下去——《穹庐下的魔女》总导演山田尚子访谈（CREA）</a><br/>☆【聲之形】（<a href=\"https://www.douban.com/link2/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.douban.com%2Fdoulist%2F44247823%2F\" rel=\"nofollow\">豆列</a>）<br/><a href=\"https://www.douban.com/link2/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fsite.douban.com%2F211330%2Fwidget%2Fnotes%2F190597056%2Fnote%2F520557685%2F\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">《聲之形》原作者大今良时＆导演山田尚子寄语</a><br/><a href=\"https://www.douban.com/link2/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsite.douban.com%2F211330%2Fwidget%2Fnotes%2F190597056%2Fnote%2F575910736%2F\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">电影《聲之形》配乐牛尾宪辅＆主题歌演唱者aiko寄语</a><br/><a href=\"https://www.douban.com/link2/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsite.douban.com%2F211330%2Fwidget%2Fnotes%2F190597056%2Fnote%2F569110361%2F\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">电影《聲之形》导演山田尚子谈选角理由</a><br/><a href=\"https://www.douban.com/link2/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsite.douban.com%2F211330%2Fwidget%2Fnotes%2F190597056%2Fnote%2F569286438%2F\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">电影《聲之形》配音演员获选感言</a><br/><a href=\"https://www.douban.com/link2/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsite.douban.com%2F211330%2Fwidget%2Fnotes%2F190597056%2Fnote%2F572997848%2F\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">电影《聲之形》配音完成感想</a><br/><a href=\"https://www.douban.com/link2/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsite.douban.com%2F211330%2Fwidget%2Fnotes%2F190597056%2Fnote%2F575615184%2F\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">电影《聲之形》导演山田尚子创作感言（《Animedia》2016年9月号）</a><br/><a href=\"https://www.douban.com/link2/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsite.douban.com%2F211330%2Fwidget%2Fnotes%2F190597056%2Fnote%2F575811208%2F\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">诚实用心地面对作品——导演山田尚子谈电影《聲之形》（《Newtype》2016年9月号）</a><br/><a href=\"https://www.douban.com/link2/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsite.douban.com%2F211330%2Fwidget%2Fnotes%2F190597056%2Fnote%2F576189949%2F\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">难能可贵，惹人怜爱——导演山田尚子谈电影《聲之形》（《Animage》2016年9月号）</a><br/><a href=\"https://www.douban.com/link2/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsite.douban.com%2F211330%2Fwidget%2Fnotes%2F190597056%2Fnote%2F581099972%2F\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">肯定世界的电影——《聲之形》导演山田尚子访谈（《Quick Japan》Vol.127）</a><br/><a href=\"https://www.douban.com/link2/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsite.douban.com%2F211330%2Fwidget%2Fnotes%2F190597056%2Fnote%2F581373515%2F\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">“约定”的手语，在缠绕的手指中展现“表情”——导演山田尚子谈电影《聲之形》（《朝日新闻》）</a><br/><a href=\"https://www.douban.com/link2/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsite.douban.com%2F211330%2Fwidget%2Fnotes%2F190597056%2Fnote%2F581617831%2F\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">描绘人的“真心”——电影《聲之形》导演山田尚子访谈（《周刊少年Magazine》2016年42号）</a><br/><a href=\"https://www.douban.com/link2/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsite.douban.com%2F211330%2Fwidget%2Fnotes%2F190597056%2Fnote%2F581837681%2F\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">通过“存在于世上”的他们传达的东西——电影《聲之形》导演山田尚子访谈（Comic Natalie）</a><br/><a href=\"https://www.douban.com/link2/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsite.douban.com%2F211330%2Fwidget%2Fnotes%2F190597056%2Fnote%2F581998436%2F\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">耳朵听不见是硝子的一种个性——电影《聲之形》导演山田尚子访谈（excite专访前篇）</a><br/><a href=\"https://www.douban.com/link2/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsite.douban.com%2F211330%2Fwidget%2Fnotes%2F190597056%2Fnote%2F582222645%2F\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">让将也发出使他好好活下去的第一声啼哭——电影《聲之形》导演山田尚子访谈（excite专访后篇）</a><br/><a href=\"https://www.douban.com/link2/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsite.douban.com%2F211330%2Fwidget%2Fnotes%2F190597056%2Fnote%2F582498318%2F\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">与山田尚子导演面对面创作的音乐——电影《聲之形》配乐牛尾宪辅访谈（Anime! Anime!）</a><br/><a href=\"https://www.douban.com/link2/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsite.douban.com%2F211330%2Fwidget%2Fnotes%2F190597056%2Fnote%2F583425563%2F\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">想让观众觉得作品中的世界就在身边——电影《聲之形》导演山田尚子访谈（Real Sound）</a><br/><a href=\"https://www.douban.com/link2/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsite.douban.com%2F211330%2Fwidget%2Fnotes%2F190597056%2Fnote%2F583976644%2F\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">电影《聲之形》首映见面会报告摘要汇总</a><br/><a href=\"https://www.douban.com/link2/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsite.douban.com%2F211330%2Fwidget%2Fnotes%2F190597056%2Fnote%2F584217092%2F\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">电影《聲之形》映后座谈会报告1（登台者：山田尚子）</a><br/><a href=\"https://www.douban.com/link2/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsite.douban.com%2F211330%2Fwidget%2Fnotes%2F190597056%2Fnote%2F585518914%2F\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">电影《聲之形》映后座谈会报告2（登台者：山田尚子、西屋太志）</a><br/><a href=\"https://www.douban.com/link2/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsite.douban.com%2F211330%2Fwidget%2Fnotes%2F190597056%2Fnote%2F586529041%2F\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">通过添加声音、色彩与动作，描写痛苦前方的出口——电影《聲之形》导演山田尚子访谈（琵雅关西版WEB）</a><br/><a href=\"https://www.douban.com/link2/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsite.douban.com%2F211330%2Fwidget%2Fnotes%2F190597056%2Fnote%2F586749537%2F\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">相信观众的感性与想象力——电影《聲之形》导演山田尚子访谈（Lmaga.jp）</a><br/><a href=\"https://www.douban.com/link2/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsite.douban.com%2F211330%2Fwidget%2Fnotes%2F190597056%2Fnote%2F586870147%2F\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">山田尚子导演是位名副其实的“电影作家”——分析电影《聲之形》的演出法（Real Sound）</a><br/><a href=\"https://www.douban.com/link2/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsite.douban.com%2F211330%2Fwidget%2Fnotes%2F190597056%2Fnote%2F620299921%2F\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">这部作品能让我直面创作的根源——电影《聲之形》导演山田尚子访谈（《Animestyle 010》）</a><br/><a href=\"https://www.douban.com/link2/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsite.douban.com%2F211330%2Fwidget%2Fnotes%2F190597056%2Fnote%2F620639436%2F\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">电影《聲之形》制作笔记（场刊）</a><br/><a href=\"https://www.douban.com/link2/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsite.douban.com%2F211330%2Fwidget%2Fnotes%2F190597056%2Fnote%2F620796838%2F\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">电影《聲之形》导演山田尚子×配乐牛尾宪辅对谈（场刊）</a><br/><a href=\"https://www.douban.com/link2/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsite.douban.com%2F211330%2Fwidget%2Fnotes%2F190597056%2Fnote%2F621091894%2F\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">结尾的曲子是在京都动画附近的河滩上边哭边想到的——电影《聲之形》配乐牛尾宪辅访谈（excite映后访谈)</a><br/><a href=\"https://www.douban.com/link2/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsite.douban.com%2F211330%2Fwidget%2Fnotes%2F190597056%2Fnote%2F621342820%2F\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">电影《聲之形》初感：一部温柔到骨子里的电影</a><br/><a href=\"https://www.douban.com/link2/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsite.douban.com%2F211330%2Fwidget%2Fnotes%2F190597056%2Fnote%2F621946123%2F\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">影像与音乐的反复结构／引用重松清《咖喱饭》的意义——记者饭田一史谈电影《聲之形》</a><br/><a href=\"https://www.douban.com/link2/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsite.douban.com%2F211330%2Fwidget%2Fnotes%2F190597056%2Fnote%2F623079239%2F\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">希望做成一部能让观众觉得自己得到原谅的作品——电影《聲之形》编剧吉田玲子访谈（Making Book）</a><br/><a href=\"https://www.douban.com/link2/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsite.douban.com%2F211330%2Fwidget%2Fnotes%2F190597056%2Fnote%2F623264433%2F\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">通过画面与声音给予观众影像体验——电影《聲之形》导演山田尚子访谈（Making Book）</a><br/><a href=\"https://www.douban.com/link2/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsite.douban.com%2F211330%2Fwidget%2Fnotes%2F190597056%2Fnote%2F623421008%2F\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">《聲之形》原作者大今良时问答摘录（漫画FANBOOK）</a><br/><a href=\"https://www.douban.com/link2/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsite.douban.com%2F211330%2Fwidget%2Fnotes%2F190597056%2Fnote%2F623887272%2F\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">欺凌与听障并非本作的主题，这是一个描写沟通的故事——《聲之形》原作者大今良时访谈摘录（漫画FANBOOK）</a><br/><a href=\"https://www.douban.com/link2/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsite.douban.com%2F211330%2Fwidget%2Fnotes%2F190597056%2Fnote%2F624120737%2F\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">她真的是个表里如一的好孩子——电影《聲之形》川井美树CV潘惠美访谈（Making Book）</a><br/><a href=\"https://www.douban.com/link2/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsite.douban.com%2F211330%2Fwidget%2Fnotes%2F190597056%2Fnote%2F624442255%2F\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">起用的理由与意外的发现——松冈茉优×山田尚子导演《聲之形》对谈（mynavi）</a>",
